{"id":"juicio","lemma":"juicio","pos":"noun","rank":764,"glosses":["good judgement; reason","opinion, judgment","judginess, judgmentalism"],"ipa":"/ˈxwiθjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"juicios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-juicio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Emití un juicio precipitado.","en":"I made a snap judgment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461634"},{"text":"Su influencia aumenta cada día, pero son poco creativos y no saben hacer juicios de valor.","en":"Their influence becomes greater every day, but they are uncreative and can't make value judgements."},{"text":"¿Habéis perdido el juicio?","en":"Have you lost your mind?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460858"},{"text":"¿Has perdido el juicio?","en":"Have you lost your mind?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460859"},{"text":"Emití un juicio a conciencia.","en":"I made a judgment call.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461635"}]}